{
    "title": "Stop & Shop",
    "description": "The Stop & Shop online and in-store shopping\u202fyou love, now even better: easier-to-redeem Go Rewards\u2122 Points and Bonus Offers, a dedicated \u201cShop\u201d section and simpler navigation. \r\n\r\nSo. Many. DEALS.  \r\n* Shop coupons, your local weekly ad, specials and much more right from the app. \r\n* Save it all to your account and automatically redeem in-store or online, when you checkout with your loyalty card. \r\n\r\nAnd as always, Stop & Shop Go Rewards\u2122 are waiting for you no matter how you shop.\u202f \r\n\r\n* Sign in to access your Stop & Shop Go Rewards\u2122 any time. \r\n* Earn Stop & Shop Rewards points for every $1 spent online or in-store. \r\n* Redeem points for fuel and grocery savings and special offers.  \r\n* Visit stopandshop.com for more information. \r\n\r\nExperience the Mobile App In-Store, too \r\n\r\n*  Sign in to access your Stop & Shop card and save it to your phone's wallet. \r\n*  Scan the digital card in-store to use your clipped coupons and rewards. \r\n* Experience Deli Order Ahead \u2014 stop waiting in game-day deli lines. \r\n* Save time and bypass the checkout line with Scan It.   \r\n \r\nYour satisfaction is our #1. Our family always takes care of your family like our own.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Stop &amp; Shop online and in-store shopping\u202fyou love, now even better: easier-to-redeem Go Rewards\u2122 Points and Bonus Offers, a dedicated \u201cShop\u201d section and simpler navigation. <br><br>So. Many. DEALS.  <br>* Shop coupons, your local weekly ad, specials and much more right from the app. <br>* Save it all to your account and automatically redeem in-store or online, when you checkout with your loyalty card. <br><br>And as always, Stop &amp; Shop Go Rewards\u2122 are waiting for you no matter how you shop.\u202f <br><br>* Sign in to access your Stop &amp; Shop Go Rewards\u2122 any time. <br>* Earn Stop &amp; Shop Rewards points for every $1 spent online or in-store. <br>* Redeem points for fuel and grocery savings and special offers.  <br>* Visit stopandshop.com for more information. <br><br>Experience the Mobile App In-Store, too <br><br>*  Sign in to access your Stop &amp; Shop card and save it to your phone&#39;s wallet. <br>*  Scan the digital card in-store to use your clipped coupons and rewards. <br>* Experience Deli Order Ahead \u2014 stop waiting in game-day deli lines. <br>* Save time and bypass the checkout line with Scan It.   <br> <br>Your satisfaction is our #1. Our family always takes care of your family like our own.",
